{"reasoning":"Key requirements: (1) recognize the screen; (2) fill the ALUNOS form using Tab/Shift+Tab and the keyboard, typing digits only for masked fields, and switch tabs to confirm data is kept; (3) provoke errors and submit; (4) restore the values, submit, read the ofício and try to go back; (5) reload and repeat the whole flow in DOCENTES; (6) give ten grounded heuristic ratings.

What went well: the agent filled every field in both tabs. The masks appear in the screenshots and tool notes (R$ 1.500,00, 01/02/1980, 05508-090, 529.982.247-25). It switched tabs both ways, and data was preserved. It triggered the three errors in both tabs, and the screenshots show the messages at the top with no per-field highlight. It submitted successfully in both tabs and the 'Solicitação registrada' ofício appeared. It tried going back and reloaded the URL. The final table has ten rows and the requested columns, and most evidence matches the screenshots: tab highlight, top-only errors, misleading 'aprovou na data de hoje' text, no buttons on the confirmation page, and placeholders that look like real values.

Problems: the route explicitly required Tab and Shift+Tab to move between fields while filling. The agent instead focused each field directly with input actions and pressed Shift+Tab only once. It admits it never checked the Tab order, yet rated heuristic 7, which specifically covers keyboard filling and Tab order, as 'Bom' without that evidence. That rating is not grounded in what was observed. It also called the ofício identical in both tabs, although the DOCENTES ofício shows a different subject ('Verba do programa'). It did not explicitly check the format on leaving each field (blur). Overall the route was largely done, but a required interaction was skipped and one heuristic's rating lacks supporting evidence, so the task was not executed exactly as asked.","verdict":false,"failure_reason":"The route required Tab and Shift+Tab navigation while filling the form, but the agent filled fields by direct focus and pressed Shift+Tab only once. As a result, heuristic 7 (keyboard filling and Tab order) received a 'Bom' rating that the agent itself says was not verified, so not all ten ratings are grounded in observed evidence. It also missed a difference between the two tabs' ofícios when calling them identical.","impossible_task":false,"reached_captcha":false}
